index 6bddff1..1abd8ba 100644
--- a/docs/api/sections/notifications.md
+++ b/docs/api/sections/notifications.md
@@ -96,3 +96,11 @@ __Request:__
 __Response:__
 
 Returns `204 No Content` on success.
+
+## Push notifications
+
+When a notification lands in the tray, Fizzy also sends a Web Push to each device the user has turned on from notification settings.
+
+The push title and body are the same text shown in the tray. Opening the push opens the card the notification is about.
+
+Ops provides the VAPID key pair as `VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY` and `VAPID_PRIVATE_KEY`. Devices subscribe by posting `push_subscription[endpoint, p256dh_key, auth_key]` to `POST /:account_slug/users/:user_id/push_subscriptions`.
diff --git a/docs/api/sections/users.md b/docs/api/sections/users.md
index 6af8e88..03d74db 100644
--- a/docs/api/sections/users.md
+++ b/docs/api/sections/users.md
@@ -148,3 +148,45 @@ Deactivates a user. You can only deactivate users you have permission to change.
 __Response:__
 
 Returns `204 No Content` on success.
+
+## `POST /:account_slug/users/:user_id/push_subscriptions`
+
+Registers the browser push subscription for the device the user is currently using. You can only register a subscription for yourself.
+
+The browser obtains the subscription from its push service. Send the fields it returns as `push_subscription`.
+
+| Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
+|-----------|------|----------|-------------|
+| `endpoint` | string | Yes | Push service URL from the browser subscription |
+| `p256dh_key` | string | Yes | Client public key (`keys.p256dh`) |
+| `auth_key` | string | Yes | Client auth secret (`keys.auth`) |
+
+Posting the same `endpoint` again updates the keys and moves the subscription to the current user.
+
+__Request:__
+
+```json
+{
+  "push_subscription": {
+    "endpoint": "https://fcm.googleapis.com/fcm/send/example",
+    "p256dh_key": "BNc...",
+    "auth_key": "k1..."
+  }
+}
+```
+
+__Response:__
+
+Returns `201 Created` for a new subscription, or `200 OK` when an existing endpoint is updated.
+
+```json
+{
+  "id": "03f5v9zjw7pz8717a4no1h8a7",
+  "endpoint": "https://fcm.googleapis.com/fcm/send/example",
+  "url": "/897362094/users/03f5v9zjw7pz8717a4no1h8a7/push_subscriptions/03f5va03bpuvkcjemcxl73ho2"
+}
+```
+
+## `DELETE /:account_slug/users/:user_id/push_subscriptions/:id`
+
+Removes a push subscription for the current user. Returns `204 No Content`.
